# A Clone copying a Doppelganger that entered with nothing to copy applies the Doppelganger's entry copy itself: it becomes a blue Bears
# with the Doppelganger's upkeep ability, which triggers at its next upkeep (CR 707.9a, 707.9e, 614.12).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Glorious Anthem
Vesuvan Doppelganger
Island
Clone
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

